program	runtime_build_suspending_body_error.saw
triple	arm64-apple-darwin
twin	same
expect	error
build	refused	cannot suspend in an `@export` function: `@export func rt_sleep` calls yield_now (`rt_sleep` suspends at line 11)
meets_expect	yes
log	"error: cannot suspend in an `@export` function: `@export func rt_sleep` calls yield_now (`rt_sleep` suspends at line 11)"
